{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"As they walk across the burrough, Sutri begins to explain the history of the burrough. \"One of the things I like so much about this place is how many different groups have been here so long. You've got the fey, the chinn natives, the jackalope natives, the wudgie natives... and then you've got the human natives, like me.\" They do an exaggerated flourish. \"Though of course i'm not fully human anymore.\" They laugh and gesture to their large ears.","created_at":"2021-08-17T08:59:28.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877114399637258260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"It's very becoming though,\" Irynx shifts back into an owlfolk and walks up to the group.","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:01:00.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877114784926031872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"But we've all been here for a long time. Not me personally, but i digress...\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:01:04.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877114802042986556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"'Different groups, but all the same at heart, people who just want to live their lives...'","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:01:14.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877114842966794302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Sutri blushes mildly. \"Why thank you. I'm a big fan of feathers myself.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:01:40.117000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877114950122893323","reply_to_id":"877114784926031872","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Well, I'm not really fully human either.\" Roy says and shifts.","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:02:09.489000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877115073317969920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I've always admired the sense of family here\" bo smiles. \"Don' matter where ya come from, it's like a big family\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:03:24.203000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-17T09:03:45.730000Z","id":"877115386691198997","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Sabrine croaks in agreement.","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:03:30.956000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877115415015354369","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Oh I *thought* you were a panther!\" Sutri exclaims as Roy shifts. \"Glad to see I was right. I can tell about people who are animal folk tanks to the bleeds, but not for other reasons.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:04:26.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877115649455964160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
