{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Yeah, I've heard people have been changing here, but I've always been like this. Back in my home town, many people are like this, but even when there are differences, one thing that unites us is the swarm.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:06:31.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877116173311950899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Anyways, now we get to the council. It wasn't until quite recently that there was really a need for one, as people mostly used to just govern ourselves. But eventually we got big enough and things around us did too, to the point where we kind of needed a group of people to make sure the things that had to get done were getting done well.\" They smile. \"Now, which of the council members are you all familiar with?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:11:47.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877117496958795806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"The twins, they're on the council right? And Ferrah. And you!\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:12:38.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877117710180446208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
